OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm,
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy evening with the low
OL,7,Frisk of an isolated shower. Cloud
OL,8,Fbuilds through the night, with patchy
OL,9,Frain developing by dawn. Very mild
OL,10,Fwith fresh winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with patchy, mostly
OL,13,Flight, rain. The rain clears to the
OL,14,Feast by mid-afternoon to leave a
OL,15,Fpartly cloudy and dry evening. Warm in
OL,16,Fthe sunshine and easing winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
